Unicode CLDR 48.2
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In rulec, and so in `ritsu` and `ritsu.wasm`. The text is crates/rulec/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES
without its title (crates.io receives the file with rulec); its paths are under crates/rulec.

rulec's built-in namespace of first-level divisions (src/prelude.rs, DESIGN.md §15.182)
holds names taken from the Unicode Common Locale Data Repository:

  Unicode CLDR 48.2 (release-48-2, 2026-03-17), https://github.com/unicode-org/cldr
    common/subdivisions/en.xml       English names of the subdivisions
    common/subdivisions/{zh,ko,hi,fr,es,it,de,pt}.xml
                                     the names in each country's language
    common/subdivisions/{ca,eu,gl,cy}.xml
                                     co-official names (Catalonia, the Balearic Islands, the
