wasi-libc of wasi-sdk 29.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

In the `ritsu.wasm` of the npm package only. Rust links a program for wasm32-wasip1 with the C
library of WASI that it carries for that target, and Rust 1.94.1, which built the module, carries
the one wasi-sdk 29.0 built (its libc.a names wasi-sdk v29.0 and clang 21.1.4). The native
binaries are linked with the C library of the system, and the module of the page in the browser
with none. Of the library, the module holds 67 objects (the linker's map): wasi-libc's own code
(how a program starts, the directories it is given, the working directory), and parts of three
works wasi-libc is made from: cloudlibc (files, directories and clocks), musl (strings, the words
of an error number, getenv, exp, log and round) and dlmalloc (malloc and free).
